# Local video files — host these externally (see work/videos/README.md)
# and never commit them to the repo. This keeps the git repo light and
# avoids GitHub's 100MB per-file limit entirely.
# Poster/thumbnail images are NOT ignored — they're small and the live
# site needs them committed to show a preview before the video plays.
work/videos/*.mp4
work/videos/*.mov
!work/videos/README.md
!work/videos/.gitkeep
!work/videos/posters/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
